    ("Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning", "What is the main benefit of parameter-efficient fine-tuning?", "Only a small set of added or selected parameters are trained, so adaptation needs far less memory and storage.", "One frozen base model can serve many tasks, each with a small set of weights.", "Easy"),
